+# Custom gfx1100 IQ4_XS Kernels -- Phase 7 Hybrid
+Source: kernels/matmul_iq4xs/
+- gemv_iq4xs.cuh: Cooperative 8-thread/row DP4A (v_dot4_i32_i8) with on-the-fly Q8_1 quantization, LDS [32][33] padded, __launch_bounds__(256,4) (decode M=1).
+- gemm_iq4xs.cuh: WMMA hardware matrix cores 64x32 double-buffered LDS [2][32][33] + fallback TILE_M=16, __launch_bounds__(256,4), GGML layouts [K,M] and [N,M] corrected (m*N+n vs n*M+m fix).
+Controlled by CMake option GGML_CUDA_ENABLE_CUSTOM_GFX1100 (default OFF).
+When OFF, compiles clean and behaves bit-identically to upstream stock.
